    whatToSay: ["\"This line is moving slower than I hoped.\"","\"It's freezing in here, isn't it?\"","\"That's a great-looking coffee — where'd you get it?\"","\"Do you know how long the wait usually is?\"","\"Have you been here before? Is it any good?\"","\"I love that bag — where's it from?\"","\"Your kid is so well-behaved, what's your secret?\""],
