    howToSayIt: "Say the name back within the first few seconds — out loud, not just in your head. When you ask someone to repeat it, do it with zero shame; people respect \"I want to get it right\" far more than a fake nod. Bringing up a detail later should sound casual, like you just thought of it, not like you've been studying notes.",
