    whatToSay: ["\"Are you usually here on Tuesdays? I'll look for you.\"","\"We always seem to end up talking — let's make it official, here's my number.\"","\"There's a [event/class/meetup] coming up — want to go together?\"","\"I'm trying to get out more this year — want to be each other's excuse?\"","\"I'll be straight with you — I'm trying to make more friends. Want to grab a coffee?\""],
