    whatToSay: ["\"Hey, it's [name] from [where] — great talking to you! Let's actually make that coffee happen.\"","\"It's [name]! Putting my number to good use — how's your week going?\"","\"Hey, it's [name] — did your son end up making the team?\"","\"It's [name] from the game. Still thinking about that [thing] you mentioned — let's grab lunch.\"","\"Are you free Saturday morning? The kids could play and we could actually talk.\"","\"There's that thing next week — want to go together?\""],
