    whatToSay: ["\"Hi, I'm new here — what should I know?\"","\"First time at this — is there anything I'm supposed to do?\"","\"Mind if I stick near you? I have no idea what I'm doing yet.\"","\"You seem like you know the ropes — can I ask you stuff?\"","\"I had a great time — I'll definitely be back next week.\"","\"Same time next week? I'll see you then.\""],
