    whatToSay: ["Present: \"How's your day going?\" / \"Crazy weather, huh?\"","Past: \"Did you have a good weekend?\" / \"How was the holiday?\"","Future: \"Any plans coming up?\" / \"Doing anything fun this weekend?\"","\"Is your kid surviving this week?\"","\"Are you ready for [upcoming school thing]?\"","\"Well, I should grab mine — good talking to you!\"","\"I'll let you go — see you around!\""],
