    whatToSay: ["\"Could you help me with [specific thing]?\"","\"Would you be able to [specific thing] by [when]?\"","\"I need [thing]. Is that doable?\"","Instead of \"I'm so sorry to ask, I know you're busy, it's totally fine if not…\" → \"Can I ask you a favor?\"","\"No pressure at all, but would you be up for…?\"","\"If it's too much, just say so — but could you…?\""],
    questionsToAsk: ["\"Is this a good time to ask you something?\"","\"What would make this easier for you to say yes to?\""],
